From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sean O'Hollaren <sean.ohollaren@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:44:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] FM-1: sound, panel controls, one-level menus

Audio: the stock mixer and OPL music run unchanged on a ring buffer
(fm1_audio.c) that the output side reads with resampling. Controls:
fm1_controls.c maps the FM-1's note keys, buttons and encoders to Doom
keys. FM1 builds skip the episode menu, show only NEW GAME and OPTIONS,
and return to the title when the level is finished.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
